  "title": "Yummy Yam Casserole",
  "description": "I call this the &#39;recipe with legs&#39; because every time I serve it, the recipe is requested. Even those who dislike yams and sweet potatoes love this tasty dish! This dish can be frozen, but freeze it without the pecan topping. Defrost before baking.",
  "authors": [
